fsh|n|A quadrumanous mammal, esp. of the family Simiadae, having teeth of the same number and form as in man, and possessing neither a tail nor cheek pouches. The name is applied esp. to species of the genus Hylobates, and is sometimes used as a general term for all Quadrumana. The higher forms, the gorilla, chimpanzee, and ourang, are often called anthropoid apes or man apes. ; One who imitates servilely (in allusion to the manners of the ape); a mimic. ; A dupe.	a:41ew,144,43;8f4n,140,2;hox,122,40;37zt,113,10;3q5n,103,194;93k3,95,3;6tr,87,17;11pu,84,13;fsh,74,2;6693,70,9;dix,67,10;2god,65,2;ajyc,61,15;3xse,56,1;3sj3,56,6~3q5n,103,194;3ugs,46,83;41ew,144,43;hox,122,40;6tr,87,17;ajyc,61,15;11pu,84,13;1p4n,16,11;53yv,16,11;37zt,113,10;dix,67,10;6693,70,9;wyo,16,9;6x9o,7,7;3sj3,56,6	v:41ew,129,15;8ot6,125,2;11pu,87,16;93k3,80,1;hox,68,1;6693,59,4;2god,55,1;aieh,18,5;9e10,17,6;3s81,14,26;1883,7,11;3sf5,4,4;76my,3,3;af1h,2,2~3s81,14,26;11pu,87,16;41ew,129,15;1883,7,11;9e10,17,6;aieh,18,5;3sf5,4,4;6693,59,4;76my,3,3;af1h,2,2;8ot6,125,2;93k3,80,1;2god,55,1;hox,68,1	V:ah9d,102,8;1x0z,78,4;7vn4,70,5;1i3z,59,1;12v6,55,2;ts5,55,12;ty7,34,5;443f,29,3;66d4,23,8;3ylm,22,2;8wu5,19,1;99zd,16,3;3dw0,13,3;3pki,12,16;4j8a,11,7~3pki,12,16;ts5,55,12;5e2o,6,9;ah9d,102,8;66d4,23,8;4j8a,11,7;1olc,7,5;7vn4,70,5;ty7,34,5;9dwt,3,4;1x0z,78,4;99zd,16,3;adw,4,3;3dw0,13,3;443f,29,3	n:41ew,153,78;8ot6,138,5;alhe,112,15;3qjx,111,15;fsh,80,3;3xse,76,4;3q5n,66,15;11pu,62,3;2kt7,61,28;5xu9,58,4;83o1,55,10;2god,55,1;3ugs,46,87;6tr,46,1;40np,41,1~3ugs,46,87;41ew,153,78;2kt7,61,28;3q5n,66,15;w46,4,15;alhe,112,15;3qjx,111,15;6tvj,19,12;83o1,55,10;9mne,0,10;alxf,9,8;3e3q,21,8;gp8,26,7;76my,13,6;8ot6,138,5	N:48cl,153,9;ajzx,129,15;744x,128,2;aqek,123,19;3m9o,94,6;1x0z,93,11;3b,91,15;alfc,91,2;9rpi,87,7;2te6,84,13;7vn4,84,13;8mdo,84,9;fsh,80,3;1i3z,79,4;cq6,74,13~8hz6,21,53;39l9,19,32;6tvj,29,23;9l01,31,21;8wu5,62,20;7gis,17,19;aqek,123,19;3ezc,9,19;ajzx,129,15;3b,91,15;9t59,43,14;cq6,74,13;7vn4,84,13;2te6,